'''The Amazing Catman''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[White Day Capsules (Gacha Event)|White Day]] gacha event. He was added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 786
|rarity = UR
|name1 = The Amazing Catman
|name2 = Illusionist Catman
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Illusionist Catman''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
The Amazing Catman operates in a manner almost identical to [[Catman (Uber Rare Cat)|Catman]]; however, as a seasonal variant, he has several distinct differences from his original counterpart. The most noticeable change is the shift of his primary target trait from [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] to Red. Despite the oversaturation of the [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]]/[[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Floating]] nuker niche, The Amazing Catman performs adequately at his intended roles.

First, his attack rate has been somewhat reduced compared to the original Catman, and his damage has been lowered accordingly to maintain balance. Nonetheless, The Amazing Catman still has marginally higher DPS than Catman. He has been given [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]], improving his matchups against the likes of [[Berserkory]], [[Two Can]] and [[Angelic Beast Rajakong]] and becoming a reliable counter to [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] and [[Pigeon de Sable]], which the original Catman could get sniped by.

Those attributes combined with his significant price cut make The Amazing Catman an excellent nuker against his target traits, as well as a decent counter to [[:Category:Wave Attack Enemies|Wave enemies]].

{{Job|Classification = Nuker & Backliner}}

